      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, so we're looking at the Horizon Build waterfront proposal. i know there's been a lot of talk about the geological surveys, but we really need this project to move forward for the revitalization plan. from an urban planning and environmental standpoint, are there any major long-term structural risks in those reports that would basically kill the proposal? or can we work around them?",
